Reorder operations to follow checks-effects-interactions: transfer tokens first, then update Vat accounting. Change to:
```solidity
function join(address usr, uint wad) external {
    require(live == 1, "GemJoin/not-live");
    require(int(wad) >= 0, "GemJoin/overflow");
    require(gem.transferFrom(msg.sender, address(this), wad), "GemJoin/failed-transfer");
    vat.slip(ilk, usr, int(wad));
    emit Join(usr, wad);
}
```

Add a reentrancy guard (mutex) to prevent reentrant calls:
```solidity
uint private locked = 1;
modifier nonReentrant() {
    require(locked == 1, "GemJoin/reentrant");
    locked = 2;
    _;
    locked = 1;
}
```
Apply to both `join` and `exit` functions.
